WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand with feet wide, toes pointing forward or slightly out.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the right knee and shift the hips toward the right foot.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the left leg long, toes flexing up if the heel stays grounded.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Bring the hands to the floor or heart, chest lifted.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Push through the right foot to switch sides.
